OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FStaying dry with plenty of
OL,6,Fstrong sunshine, although wispy high
OL,7,Fcloud may turn the sunshine hazier at
OL,8,Ftimes. Slightly breezier than on
OL,9,FMonday but higher temperatures and
OL,10,Fbecoming very warm across southern
OL,11,Fcounties.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FPlenty of evening sunshine
OL,14,Fand then dry overnight with prolonged
OL,15,Fclear periods and variable cloud.
OL,16,FStaying rather warm in urban areas but
OL,17,Fcooler in the countryside by dawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
